   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Future perfect",
     "texto": [
      "**Vil have + participle** expresses that something will already be finished at a future moment: **Om en uge vil hun have afsluttet projektet.** = In a week she will have finished the project. With verbs that form the perfect with **være**, that auxiliary is also kept: **Om en uge vil hun være kommet hjem.**",
      "In the conditional, **ville have/være + participle** is used, depending on the verb's auxiliary."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conditional perfect",
     "texto": [
      "With **ville have** + participle you talk about something that would have happened: **Hun ville have afsluttet projektet.** = She would have finished the project. Remember lesson 070: **ville** gives the sense of «would» or «would like»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
